From: Codex
Subject: [PATCH] shader: opt-in Wave32 lowering for two tiled water programs

Adapt the local 2e01ab4 Wave32 transmission and deterministic fxceless
transmission-bounds overlays to the Fox translator. The earlier wave-wide
selection follows fxceless/victory-fork #823 (Felix2180). GPL-3.0-or-later.
